  "phase0Conclusions": [
    "Pi managed compatibility and whisper.cpp native smoke consumed about 6m24s, roughly 80% of the measured Product Gate wall time.",
    "Security-closeout and local-video contracts are currently duplicated across the two normal gates.",
    "Several current steps are mixed-owner bundles and should be split by observed architecture contract before catalog freeze.",
    "Live WebMCP is necessary runtime evidence for Skin/surface/verifier changes; #1920 and #1923 demonstrate two different failure classes that static contracts alone did not surface.",
    "The repository already has many specialized workflows; the seven-layer design should reuse/coordinate them instead of recreating their evidence.",
    "No required-gate behavior should change during Phase 0."
